  <h1>Lettuce Root Rot in Hydroponics: Why Your Roots Are Brown and Slimy</h1>
</article>
<figure class="hero">
  <img src="/images/hero-lettuce-root-rot-hydroponics.jpg" alt="A net cup lifted out of a hydroponic channel showing lettuce roots, white and firm at the top and brown and slimy below" loading="eager" width="1344" height="768" />
